OL,3,GNEWSAAuthor's camping trip inspired
OL,4,AHollywood film Wicker
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn author who was inspired to write a
OL,7,Fshort story after seeing wicker
OL,8,Fsculptures on a camping trip has said
OL,9,Fshe never imagined it would become a
OL,10,Fraunchy A-list feature film.
OL,12,FUrsula Wills from Stroud, in
OL,13,FGloucestershire, had just returned from
OL,14,Fa holiday in Cornwall in 2006 when she
OL,15,Fwrote The Wicker Husband, which follows
OL,16,Fan ostracised fisherwoman who pays a
OL,17,Fbasket-maker to weave her a husband.
OL,19,FThe story was picked up by writers who
OL,20,F"livened it up" for the big screen to
OL,21,Fbecome Wicker, starring Olivia Colman,
OL,22,FAlexander Skarsgard and Peter Dinklage.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
